spaghetti
---------
networkex is a port of spaghetti (https://github.com/pysal/spaghetti) and follows its
behaviour. Portions of native/networkex_core (also compiled into the precompiled NIF
libraries) and of lib/networkex/network.ex are derived from the source code of spaghetti 1.7.6.

