CPython
-------
native/networkex_core/src/hypot.rs (also compiled into the precompiled NIF libraries) is a
modified port of math.hypot from CPython 3.13 (vector_norm in Modules/mathmodule.c);
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md summarises the changes.

